      "crew": "1 pilot (Mark of Storm or DC 22 check)",
      "description": "<p>A recent innovation from House Lyrandar and Zil elemental binders, the Lyrandar Skyskiff is a nimble, compact vessel used for swift courier work, patrol, and emergency towing of larger grounded craft. Ringed by a contained elemental matrix, it glides through the air with unmatched responsiveness.</p>\n<p><strong>Tow Cable &amp; Harpoon:</strong> Equipped with an arcane winch and tether-hook capable of anchoring or pulling vessels and cargo within 100 feet.</p>",
